"quote":"秋遂卒，子晏嗣。晏及弟景、玄、機、雲、分領抗兵。晏為裨將軍、夷道監。天紀四年，晉軍伐吳，龍驤將軍王浚順流東下。所至輒克，終如抗慮。景字士仁，以尚公主拜騎都尉，封毗陵侯，既領抗兵，拜偏將軍、中夏督，澡身好學，著書數十篇也。二月壬戌，晏為王浚別軍所殺。癸亥，景亦遇害，時年三十一。景妻，孫皓適妹，與景俱張承外孫也。","source_term":"子晏嗣。晏及弟景、玄、機、雲、分領抗兵"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-wu058-kang-son-1","interpretation_note":"本句所記父子；識別後綴不表示長幼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}},{"id":"40p_eb9_ggr_B","label":"陸晏","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","review":"ai_provisional","aliases":[{"surface":"晏","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line087:m0005","c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line087:m0008","c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line087:m0024","c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line087:m0115","c-sanguozhi-057-yu-sons:line034-pei02-01:m0098"]},{"surface":"陆晏","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-057-yu-sons:line034-pei02-01:m0095"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-058","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-058-lukang","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line087","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line087:m0005","quote":"晏"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-058","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-058-lukang","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line087","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line087:m0008","quote":"晏"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-058","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-058-lukang","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line087","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line087:m0024","quote":"晏"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-058","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-058-lukang","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line087","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line087:m0115","quote":"晏"},{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-057","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yu-sons","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-057-yu-sons","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yu-sons:line034-pei02-01","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yu-sons:line034-pei02-01:m0095","quote":"陆