ozhi-057-yu-sons:line034-pei02-01","quote":"《会稽典录》曰：忠字世方，翻第五子。贞固幹事，好识人物，造吴郡陆机於童龀之年，称上虞魏迁於无名之初，终皆远致，为著闻之士。交同县王岐於孤宦之族，仕进先至宜都太守，忠乃代之。晋征吴，忠与夷道监陆晏、晏弟中夏督景坚守不下，城溃被害。忠子谭，字思奥。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yu-sons:line034-pei02-01:m0095","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yu-sons:line034-pei02-01:m0103"}],"interpretation_note":"以此來源所述兩端為據。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-wu058-kang-son-0","subject_person_id":"40p_eb9_ggr_B","object_person_id":"40p_eb9_ggr","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"子晏嗣。晏及弟景、玄、機、雲、分領抗兵"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-058","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-058-lukang","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line087","quote":"秋遂卒，子晏嗣。晏及弟景、玄、機、雲、分領抗兵。晏為裨將軍、夷道監。天紀四年，晉軍伐吳，龍驤將軍王浚順流東下。所至輒克，終如抗慮。景字士仁，以尚公主拜騎都尉，封毗陵侯，既領抗兵，拜偏將軍、中夏督，澡身好學，著書數十篇也。二月壬戌，晏為王浚別軍所殺。癸亥，景亦遇害，時年三十一。景妻，孫皓適妹，與景俱張承外孫也。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line087:m0005","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line087:m0021"}],"interpretation_note":"以此來源所述兩端為據。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[{"connection":"father","parent_person_id":"40p_eb9_ggr","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-058","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-058-lukang","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line087","quote":"秋遂卒，子晏嗣。晏及弟景、玄、機、雲、分領抗兵。晏為裨將軍、夷道監。天紀四年，晉軍伐吳，龍驤將軍王浚順流東下。所至輒克，終如抗慮。景字士仁，以尚公主拜騎都尉，封毗陵侯，既領抗兵，拜偏將軍、中夏督，澡身好學，著書數十篇也。二月壬戌，晏為王浚別軍所殺。癸亥，景亦遇害，時年三十一。景妻，孫皓適妹，與景俱張承外孫也。","source_term":"子晏嗣。晏及弟景、玄、機、雲、分領抗兵"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-wu058-kang-son-0","interpretation_note